DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The uuwwaaccoomm driver provides basic support for Wacom USB tablets.  Access
     to these devices is through the wscons(4) framework.

     Absolute positioning of the mouse cursor can be done by hovering the pen
     above the tablet.  Touching the tablet with the pen tip will emulate
     mouse button 0, while the two pen buttons will emulate button 1 and but‐
     ton 2.

     The uuwwaaccoomm driver supports the following Wacom tablets:

           _N_a_m_e           _M_o_d_e_l _N_u_m_b_e_r
           Intuos Draw    CTL-490
           Intuos S       CTL-4100
           One S          CTL-472
           One M          CTL-672

